ched_details = UsageProcessor._cache_details_if_enabled(\n+            sum(tok for idx, tok in cached_tokens.items() if idx % n_choices == 0),\n+            enable_cache_report,\n         )\n \n         return UsageProcessor.calculate_token_usage(",
